\b0\fs36 Retrieving Data\par
You can retrieve data from multiple sources:\par
\par

\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl240\slmult1 SQL databases\par
